one:
&threeGE;
&four;


   xmllint --loaddtd  --noent  --valid 34-dual-trees.xml

   Gives more of a hint about when parsing should happen.
   the definition for threeGE and threePE is two parameter entities whose
   repalcement text is %one;

   in threeGE, that's the final text.  We don't parse the text again.
   in threePE, that text is also not parsed but in four it is then parsed.
